OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start but some light
OL,6,Frain or showers developing by late
OL,7,Fmorning, a few showers turning heavy
OL,8,Fand thundery, especially over southern
OL,9,FAberdeenshire, these could be slow to
OL,10,Fmove away with very light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FHeavier showers dying out but
OL,13,Fshowers through the night especially
OL,14,Ffor North Aberdeenshire and Moray,
OL,15,Ffeeling cooler with freshening
OL,16,Fnortherly winds.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FQuite breezy and feeling
OL,19,Ffresher with some showers, Southern
OL,20,FAberdeenshire likely to see some
OL,21,Fshelter from showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
